      "updated": 1757077507135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Customer Makes an account on the platform if hasn't made one already.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Customer Makes an account on the platform if hasn't made one already.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2p-Pk_UB9YMO2HeUYvglJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6453.268985618418,
      "y": 275.67077574867733,
      "width": 1892.0082128267406,
      "height": 86.47774575728471,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1339855421,
      "version": 685,
      "versionNonce": 907334729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757077512899,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Customer then either imports itirenary from someone else (if doing a group tour) or makes an itirenary\nthemself.",
      "fontSize": 34.591098302913885,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Customer then either imports itirenary from someone else (if doing a group tour) or makes an itirenary themself.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2rtz7iEMwJKp1QkUBHoJg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6635.736815143083,
      "y": 462.40317547553764,
      "width": 1323.1817626953125,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 27784979,
      "version": 674,
      "versionNonce": 1592091433,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757077512899,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "After specification of the itirenary, they will return to the \"my tours\" page",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After specification of the itirenary, they will return to the \"my tours\" page",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
